    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] ......他跑了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "......他跑了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 爷爷，您没事——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "爷爷，您没事——"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 你都做了啥！啊呀，塔露拉......你看看你都做了啥！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "你都做了啥！啊呀，塔露拉......你看看你都做了啥！"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 塔露拉，再过两天我们就要迁村子了。你看看你这样......！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "塔露拉，再过两天我们就要迁村子了。你看看你这样......！"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 你打了纠察队啊！这可惹上大麻烦了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "你打了纠察队啊！这可惹上大麻烦了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 继续让他打你更不是办法。现在已经晚了，他逃了。我现在杀了他，其他人发现他踪迹的时候，我们就已经迁走了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "继续让他打你更不是办法。现在已经晚了，他逃了。我现在杀了他，其他人发现他踪迹的时候，我们就已经迁走了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 可那样死活是避不过的，纠察队一旦集结起来，一定还会找上我们。说不定还会报复我们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "可那样死活是避不过的，纠察队一旦集结起来，一定还会找上我们。说不定还会报复我们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 那你还动手！这该怎么办！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "那你还动手！这该怎么办！"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 放心，爷爷，他们是找感染者。现在他们还不知道。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "放心，爷爷，他们是找感染者。现在他们还不知道。"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 不知道什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "不知道什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 不知道我接下来要做的事。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "不知道我接下来要做的事。"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 哎......塔露拉！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "哎......塔露拉！"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 爷爷，没事的。来，我扶你回去。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "爷爷，没事的。来，我扶你回去。"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 你这条腿......可有得治了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "你这条腿......可有得治了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 哈。没想到我也到了被你搀着这天。我一直觉得我的身体还好着，只是没想到还是没逃过去。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "哈。没想到我也到了被你搀着这天。我一直觉得我的身体还好着，只是没想到还是没逃过去。"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 塔露拉，我有件事，你一定要听。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "塔露拉，我有件事，你一定要听。"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 又是什么事，爷爷？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "又是什么事，爷爷？"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5"
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"老汉\"] 啊，是什么来着？唔，哈哈，对不住，我忘啦。你看看，你看我这记性......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老汉",
        "content": "啊，是什么来着？唔，哈哈，对不住，我忘啦。你看看，你看我这记性......"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"] 您那忘性可还真够大的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "您那忘性可还真够大的。"
